{"version":1,"content":"<p>Neuralink再次展示其腦機接口技術的應用潛力：一名參與臨牀試驗的患者僅憑大腦意念，成功操控Rockstar Games的新作《俠盜獵車手VI》（GTA VI）。該公司於11月20日在社交平台X發佈了一段約兩分鐘的遊戲視頻，此時距離《GTA VI》登陸主機僅過去一天。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587658.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.498459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:11:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"8a9bf518cc9cb39426e022de9f76a23063d81bd73cd2130a3a146cf327614025","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}